If you really must experiment, at least don't read the cursed scrolls.
Also, make sure you are only wearing ONE piece of armour (preferrably a
helmet, they are easy to replace), in case it is a destroy armour
spell. Also, be sure to carry at least ONE wand. You wouldn't want to
spoil a scroll of charging. Next, drop all your spellbooks, scrolls
(except for the one you're trying to identify) and potions, just in
case you're going to read a scroll of fire (having some HP left will
also help here).

When you plan to read an unidentified spellbook and your INT and WIS
aren't very high, you may consider dropping your gold first.

